              <mxPoint x="1128" y="100" />
              <mxPoint x="388" y="100" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v17" value="&lt;b&gt;Step 1&amp;#8211;3: simple paths L&amp;#8594;B, path strength q(P) = &amp;#8719; edge weights &amp;#215; 0.7&lt;sup&gt;hops&amp;#8722;1&lt;/sup&gt;, strongest path per first hop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table border='1' cellpadding='4' style='border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px'&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#E3EEF9'&gt;&lt;th&gt;Path&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;nodes&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;hops&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;&amp;#8719; w&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;&amp;#947;&lt;sup&gt;hops&amp;#8722;1&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;q(P)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;k = 3 decision&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;P1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;L&amp;#8594;A&amp;#8594;B&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.7714&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.70&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;&lt;b&gt;0.5400&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;selected (strongest via A)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;P2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;L&amp;#8594;D&amp;#8594;B&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.3000&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.70&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;&lt;b&gt;0.2100&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;selected (strongest via D)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;P3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;L&amp;#8594;A&amp;#8594;E&amp;#8594;B&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.6480&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.49&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;&lt;b&gt;0.3175&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;dropped: weaker path via A&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;P4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;L&amp;#8594;C&amp;#8594;E&amp;#8594;B&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.4480&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.49&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;&lt;b&gt;0.2195&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;selected (strongest via C)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;P5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;L&amp;#8594;C&amp;#8594;F&amp;#8594;G&amp;#8594;B&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.5832&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.34&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;&lt;b&gt;0.2000&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;excluded: hops &amp;gt; k = 3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#1d1d1d;spacing=2;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="120" width="620" height="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v18" value="&lt;b&gt;Step 4: noisy-OR over selected paths&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;I(L,B) = 1 &amp;#8722; &amp;#8719;(1 &amp;#8722; q) = 1 &amp;#8722; (1 &amp;#8722; 0.5400) &amp;#215; (1 &amp;#8722; 0.2195) &amp;#215; (1 &amp;#8722; 0.2100) = &lt;b&gt;0.7164&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Step 5: reliability with path-diversity and cap&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;|P| = 3, first hops = 3&lt;br&gt;&amp;#961; = min(0.6, min(1, 3/3) &amp;#183; min(1, 3/2) &amp;#183; 0.7164) = min(0.6, 0.7164) = &lt;b&gt;0.6000&lt;/b&gt; (capped)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Step 6: indirect estimate&lt;/b&gt; (t_v = 0.80 borrower's direct mean from others, b = 0.70 baseline; illustrative)&lt;br&gt;t_indirect = b + &amp;#961;(t_v &amp;#8722; b) = 0.70 + 0.60 &amp;#215; 0.10 = &lt;b&gt;0.760&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Indirect evidence supplements direct evidence; on its own it can never give SUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE (Overview 5.11)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#1d1d1d;spacing=2;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="470" width="620" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v19" value="&lt;b&gt;k sweep on this graph&lt;/b&gt; (NFR-P-03 reports latency for k = 1..4)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table border='1' cellpadding='4' style='border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px'&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#E3EEF9'&gt;&lt;th&gt;k&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;paths found&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;selected&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;I&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;&amp;#961;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;t_indirect&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.0000&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.0000&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;none (D3 ext 3a)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.6366&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.4244&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.742&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.7164&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.6000&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.760&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.7164&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.6000&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align='center'&gt;0.760&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;br&gt;k = 4 finds P5 but it is weaker than P4 through the same first hop C, so the result does not change: one path per first hop stops correlated paths being double-counted." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#1d1d1d;spacing=2;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="740" width="620" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v20" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B0BAC4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="760" width="1160" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v21" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read the graph&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Directed edge X&amp;#8594;Y = verified evidence X holds about Y for the same role and metric (weight in (0, 1]), built by TrustEdgeProjector from confirmed outcomes only. Bold edges lie on the selected paths; grey edges are found but not used.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;What the example checks&lt;/b&gt; (test suite 7: expected paths, decay, one path per first hop, noisy-OR, &amp;#961; &amp;#8804; 0.6, nothing beyond k, cycles safe)&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; decay: P3 (3 hops) is multiplied by 0.49, P1 (2 hops) by 0.7, a 1-hop path by 1.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; one path per first hop: P1 and P3 both start L&amp;#8594;A; only the stronger P1 counts.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; bound: P5 has 4 hops and is ignored at k = 3.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; cycles: B&amp;#8594;A would allow L&amp;#8594;A&amp;#8594;B&amp;#8594;A&amp;#8230;; simple paths never revisit a node.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; cap: I = 0.72 would give &amp;#961; = 0.72; the cap keeps indirect reliability &amp;#8804; 0.6 (always below direct evidence).&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; diversity: if only P1 existed, &amp;#961; = min(1,1/3)&amp;#183;min(1,1/2)&amp;#183;0.5400 = 0.0900.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Complexity&lt;/b&gt;: bounded DFS from u visits at most &amp;#931;&lt;sub&gt;h&amp;#8804;k&lt;/sub&gt; d&lt;sup&gt;h&lt;/sup&gt; = O(d&lt;sup&gt;k&lt;/sup&gt;) partial paths (d = max out-degree); with k = 3 and neighbourhood-sized d this is small. Selection is O(|paths|), noisy-OR O(|first hops|).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Edge weight (ADR-0006)&lt;/b&gt;: weight = (1 + s&lt;sub&gt;w&lt;/sub&gt;) / (2 + s&lt;sub&gt;w&lt;/sub&gt; + f&lt;sub&gt;w&lt;/sub&gt;), the recency-weighted Beta posterior mean of what the source confirmed about the target; labels show successes &amp;#10003; and failures &amp;#10007;." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#1d1d1d;spacing=2;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="768" width="1140" height="262" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>